{"format":"telly-addicts-eps","v":1,"show":"Super Mario Bros","i":4478,"eps":[{"s":1,"e":1,"t":"The Bird! The Bird!","a":"1989-09-04","l":30,"d":"While crossing the Land of Ice, Toad gets kidnapped by a Giant Birdo who thinks the Mushroom is her missing baby.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/600/1500407.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":2,"t":"King Mario of Cramalot","a":"1989-09-05","l":30,"d":"With the help of the wizard Mervin, Mario pulls the Golden Plumber's Helper from the magic sink and saves the Land of Cramalot from evil King Koopa.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/600/1500413.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":3,"t":"Butch Mario & the Luigi Kid","a":"1989-09-06","l":30,"d":"The Gang goes on the hunt for the Chaos Emeralds. Yoshi is attacked by Mecha Sonic.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0pZP3nGExgVwU6Dj4FJ29iLKrA.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":4,"t":"Mario's Magic Carpet","a":"1989-09-07","l":30,"d":"As Yoshi heals at Mario's House, the Gang continues the hunt, but are ambushed by the Koopa Bros.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGBhLyQ3hmmdFqQ3vzyLmbjUAU6.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":5,"t":"Rolling Down the River","a":"1989-09-11","l":30,"d":"The Gang travels to Yoshi's Island in search of the lost Chaos Emerald. There, they find that the locals are in trouble.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqWLGlkix73I26mJYIZxvLTJxj1.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":6,"t":"The Great Gladiator Gig","a":"1989-09-12","l":30,"d":"The Mario Team, Koopa Bros. and Axem Rangers X fight for the Chaos Emeralds. Mecha Sonic arrives, spelling doom for Yoshi's Island.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/goTULLxZEI7DhahGQF1i9g7OYtW.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":7,"t":"Mario and the Beanstalk","a":"1989-09-13","l":30,"d":"With Stuffwell joining the team, the Gang search the Pipe Maze for the fifth Emerald, but a run in with Mecha Sonic sees our heroes trapped in a world of negative space.","img":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4c6HvO2h51sBfaobaQW6oJ7qLA1.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":8,